==English==
{{Wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|πυλωρός||gatekeeper}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|pylori|+}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} The opening in a [[vertebrate]], including [[human]]s, at the lower end of the [[stomach]] that opens into the [[duodenum]].
# A [[muscular]] or [[myovascular]] structure that controls the opening of an orifice or [[lumen]] of an organ.

